OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FStudent musicians unite under
OL,7,     Fconductor Sakari Oramo to perform
OL,8,     FHolst's suite alongside Sibelius's
OL,9,     FThe Wood Nymph and a new work from
OL,10,     FFinnish-American composer Lara
OL,11,     FPoe.
OL,12,G0630 Breakfast
OL,13,     FHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,14,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,15,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,16,G0900 Saturday Morning
OL,17,     FOlivier Latry talks to Tom about
OL,18,     FBach, Jess Gillam shares her
OL,19,     Fthoughts on the Prom she's
OL,20,     Fperforming at in Gateshead, and
OL,21,     FMark-Anthony Turnage discusses his
OL,22,     F2025 hit opera Festen.
